Package: GambleR
Title: Educational Gamblegram for Acid-Base Visualization
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Juan Camilo", "Castellanos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "juan.castellanos@urosario.edu.co")
Description: Modular educational Shiny application for visualizing plasma
    electroneutrality using a Gamblegram-inspired representation. The
    application is not intended for clinical decision-making.
